# Brain Tasks App --- AWS Production Deployment

## 1. Project Overview

This project demonstrates the end-to-end deployment of a React
application to AWS using Docker, Amazon ECR, Amazon EKS, AWS CodeBuild,
AWS CodePipeline, Kubernetes, IAM, and CloudWatch.

### End-to-end architecture

``` text
Developer
   |
   | git push
   v
GitHub
   |
   v
AWS CodePipeline
   |
   v
AWS CodeBuild
   |
   | Docker build
   | Docker tag
   | Docker push
   v
Amazon ECR
   |
   v
CodePipeline EKS Deploy
   |
   | kubectl apply
   v
Amazon EKS
   |
   +--> Kubernetes Deployment
   |        |
   |        v
   |      Pod
   |
   +--> Kubernetes Service
            |
            v
       AWS LoadBalancer
            |
            v
         Browser

Monitoring:
EKS -> Fluent Bit -> CloudWatch Logs
```

