# Phase 1 --- Clone and Run the Application

The application was cloned from GitHub:

``` bash
git clone https://github.com/Vennilavanguvi/Brain-Tasks-App.git
cd Brain-Tasks-App
```

The application was first verified locally before containerization.

The application runs on port `3000`.

Example:

``` bash
npm install
npm start
```

The goal of this phase was to confirm that the application itself works
before introducing Docker and AWS.

