# Phase 11 --- AWS CodeBuild

AWS CodeBuild builds the Docker image and pushes it to ECR.

The build process is defined in:

``` text
buildspec.yml
```

High-level flow:

``` text
Source
  |
  v
CodeBuild
  |
  +--> Authenticate with ECR
  |
  +--> Docker build
  |
  +--> Tag image
  |
  +--> Push image
  |
  v
ECR
```

The buildspec contains phases such as:

``` yaml
phases:
  pre_build:
    commands:
      - echo Logging in to Amazon ECR...

  build:
    commands:
      - echo Building Docker image...
      - docker build -t $IMAGE_URI .

  post_build:
    commands:
      - echo Pushing Docker image to ECR...
      - docker push $IMAGE_URI
```

The image tag uses the CodeBuild build number, allowing the ECR image to
be traced back to a build.

Example:

``` text
sundar-brain-tasks:9
```

