# Phase 15 --- EKS Deployment Through CodePipeline

The deployment stage performs operations similar to:

``` bash
aws eks update-kubeconfig --region ap-south-1 --name brain-tasks-eks
```

Then:

``` bash
kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml -f service.yaml -n default
```

Then it waits for the rollout:

``` bash
kubectl rollout status -w deployment.apps/brain-tasks-deployment -n default
```

This ensures the pipeline waits for the Kubernetes Deployment to
successfully roll out.

