# Phase 16 --- EKS IAM Access

The CodePipeline deployment role needs access to the EKS cluster.

There are two separate concepts:

### AWS IAM

Controls AWS API permissions.

### Kubernetes authorization

Controls what an authenticated identity can do inside the cluster.

The deployment role was added to the EKS access configuration so that
the pipeline could execute Kubernetes operations.

Conceptually:

``` text
CodePipeline IAM Role
       |
       v
EKS authentication
       |
       v
Kubernetes authorization
       |
       v
kubectl apply
```

